OL,3,GNEWSATriple killer's mum warned police
OL,4,Anot to release him
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother repeatedly tried to warn
OL,7,Fpolice not to release her son from
OL,8,Fcustody because he was mentally unwell
OL,9,Fand could be aggressive and violent -
OL,10,Fless than two days before he would go
OL,11,Fon to kill three elderly men during a
OL,12,Fpsychotic episode, inquests have heard.
OL,14,FAlexander Lewis-Ranwell, now 35, had
OL,15,Fbeen arrested twice and released from
OL,16,Fcustody before he killed Anthony Payne,
OL,17,F80, and twins Roger and Dick Carter, 84
OL,18,Fin Exeter on 10 February 2019.
OL,20,FJill Lewis-Ranwell said she spoke to
OL,21,Fofficers at Barnstaple police station
OL,22,Fduring the first arrest.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
