OL,3,GNEWSATriple killer's mum warned police
OL,4,Anot to release him
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement she said: "I told them
OL,7,Fhe had a history of violence when
OL,8,Funwell and that I would have grave
OL,9,Fconcerns if he was released."
